  "gameDescriptionHtml": "\n<p>Fe is a new type of platform adventure where the story is up to you to discover, without handholding, told wordlessly through the discoveries you make during gameplay.</p>\n<p>Become Fe and discover a world that you will never want to leave. </p>\n<p><b>Game Features</b></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Discover a world worth exploring. Run, climb and glide your way through a dark Nordic forest and explore its living, breathing ecosystem filled with secrets and mystical creatures.\n</li><li>Speak the language of the forest. At the heart of the experience is a tactile, analogue song mechanic that allows you to communicate and speak to every living thing in the forest.\n</li><li>Defeat the Silent Ones. Learn a diverse array of animal cries that allow you to befriend or manipulate any creature – even plants. Have birds guide you, bears fight for you and have plants grow berries that help you overcome the Silent Ones.\n</li></ul>\n",
